      "raw": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">When fighting Miss Information in Freedom Tower, there&#39;s an odd interaction between her Suspicious Malfunction ongoing &amp; the Caspit&#39;s &quot;Playground&quot; room that I&#39;m pretty sure is a bug. With the Playground is in play, when&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Suspicious Malfunction triggers at the start of Miss I&#39;s turn, it correctly allows me to destroy any of my hero ongoing cards as they Playground causes them to count as equipment. &nbsp;However, any cards destroyed that way do not count as &quot;equipment cards destroyed this turn&quot; for the purposes of lowering the damage that&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Suspicious Malfunction then doles out.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">I had this happen in a random game, then re-tested it in a 2nd game and the same thing happened. &nbsp;I do have screenshots if they&#39;d be helpful (but no log as I&#39; play on iPad). &nbsp;I didn&#39;t see this listed on Trello, so I don&#39;t know if it&#39;s come up before.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
